WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
[UNIVERSAL STUDIOS THEME
PLAYING]

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.100
[SQUEAKING]

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.150
[DOGS BARKING]

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.630
MINION: [SCREAMING] Stop, ah!

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.050
Stop ah!

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.160
[PANTING]
[PAWS PADDING]

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.210
[LAUGHS]

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.400
[SQUEAKING]

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.840
[BARK]
- Eh!

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:38.890
Illumination!

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:39.940
[PAWS RUNNING]

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.210
[BARKING]

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:48.510
[MUSIC - JAY Z AND ALICIA KEYS -
"EMPIRE STATE OF MIND"]

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
Yeah I'm out that Brooklyn,
now I'm down in Tribeca.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.960
Right next to DeNiro,
but I'll be hood forever.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.010
[BELL RINGS]

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.850
I'm the new Sinatra, and
since I made it here,

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.260
I can make it anywhere.
- [LAUGHING]

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.490
Yeah, they love me everywhere.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.420
In New York--
- Yes.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.530
Ayy, ah-ha.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.580
Yeah.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.460
--concrete jungle where
dreams are made of.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.360
There's nothing you can't do.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.410
[DISTANT BARKING]

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:11.370
Now you're in New York.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.690
MAX (VOICEOVER):
[INALES] Ah, kids.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:13.960
[YAPPING]

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.520
Everybody loves them, right?
[BARKING]

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.140
[LAUGHING]
You probably love kids.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.800
Hey!

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.780
MAX (VOICEOVER): I
got to admit, I don't.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:23.950
That's me, by the way.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.060
I'm Max.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.860
I'm the little dog
right there, grateful

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.310
I'm not being piled on
by a horde of children.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:30.360
[THUD]

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.230
[LAUGHING] Wait for me!
MAX (VOICEOVER): Ugh.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.400
Can you believe that?

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.430
[LAUGHING] Oh, having
a kid looks like fun.

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.720
Nah, man, it ain't fun.

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.880
I'm telling you, once the
humans bring a kid home,

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.650
your life ain't the same.
[GALLOPING]

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:42.700
[BARKING]
- Whoa!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.250
[SCREAMING]

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.960
Seen it a billion times.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.010
It changes you.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:49.060
[MUSIC - JAY Z AND ALICIA KEYS -
"EMPIRE STATE OF MIND"]

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.110
The Empire State that's--

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.160
New York.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.160
MAX (VOICEOVER): Now, thought
I never had to worry about any

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.560
of that, but then one day--
[BELL JINGLES]

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.610
[THUD]

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:56.740
[SCREAMS] Ow!

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.470
MAX (VOICEOVER): --my
owner, Katy, met Chuck.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:00.520
[TRAFFIC ZOOMING]

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.910
Are you OK?

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:02.960
MAX (VOICEOVER): [SIGHS]

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.390
Uh, Yeah.
[SLURP]

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.180
[LAUGHS]
[PANTING]

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.310
MAX (VOICEOVER): A little
while later, they're married.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.360
Hi, guys!

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.660
MAX (VOICEOVER):
Which it-- it's great.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.580
[EXICTED SCURRYING]
Chuck is real-- he's a good guy.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.750
[BARKING]

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.800
But then--

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.030
Aw.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.520
MAX (VOICEOVER):
--something happened.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:18.570
[GASPS]

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.410
[THUD] [CHUCKLES]

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.460
[WHINING]

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:22.510
[SNORING]

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.340
[SOFT LULLABYE MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.230
[COOING]

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.480
MAX (VOICEOVER): Katie and
Chuck had a kid of their own.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.270
His name's Liam.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:35.140
[SQUEAK]

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.720
At first he slept all the time.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.400
Dreaming about,
you know, whatever

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.380
it is that babies dream about.
[CHAIR SQEAKING]

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.740
[LAUGHTER]
- Who's a cutie pie?

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:43.850
He had his place--

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.210
Who's a cutie pie?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.570
MAX (VOICEOVER): And I had mine.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.730
Things seem like they
were going to be fine.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.110
[EXCITED YELLING]
- [SNORTS] What?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.160
Ya, ya, we!

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.730
MAX (VOICEOVER): Until
he started talking.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.200
Aye!
[RATTLING]

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.250
Ee!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.570
Ya, ya, I [BABBLING]
[THUMP]

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.620
Do!

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.090
Hi!

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:03.970
MAX (VOICEOVER): And
eventually, he started crawling.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.180
- Gee!
- [YELPS]

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.230
Wow.
[THUD]

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:07.590
MAX (VOICEOVER): Sort of.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:08.810
[GRUNTING]

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.140
MAX (VOICEOVER): And suddenly
my own home wasn't safe anymore.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.190
[LAUGHING]

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:13.340
[THUMPING]

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.350
MAX (VOICEOVER): There was a
tiny monster taking it over.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.400
[LAUGHING]

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.900
MAX (VOICEOVER): Now, I did my
best to keep a safe distance.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.320
[YELPING]
- Ah!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.370
[BOOM]

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:25.070
[LAUGHING] [GIBBERISH]
Aye, ya, ya!

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.560
[SLURPING]

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.080
MAX (VOICEOVER):
But then one day,

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.750
Liam did something
I never expected.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.030
Max!

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.650
[DOG TAG CLINKING]

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.390
I love you, Max.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:37.560
MAX (VOICEOVER):
And from then on--

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.760
[LAUGHING]

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:39.810
MAX (VOICEOVER):
--everything was different.

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.500
[MUSIC - STEVIE WONDER - "I WAS
MADE TO LOVE HER"]

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.550
[MOANING]
[SLURPING]

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:43.600
[SCRAPING]
[LIQUID SLOSHING]

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.650
Ahh!
[CHOMPING]

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.860
MAX (VOICEOVER): Duke and I, we
became like role models to him.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.280
Mm-Mm.
Nom, nom, nom.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.330
- [CHUCKLES]
- [LAUGHS]

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.760
[LAUGHS]

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.050
MAX (VOICEOVER):
Like, what can I say?

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:53.370
The kid's a fan!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:57.770
So tenderly, my life grows
sweeter through the years.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.020
[LAUGHING]

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.070
I know that my baby loves me.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.600
MAX (VOICEOVER): We try
to be a good influence.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.650
- [BEGGING]
- [LAUGHING]

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:06.280
My baby needs me, that's why
we've made through the years.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.330
I need to wobble!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.050
[THUD]

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.850
MAX (VOICEOVER): And we help
them out whenever we can.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:11.900
That's it.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.180
[HYSTERICAL LAUGHING]

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.390
MAX (VOICEOVER):
This kid gets us.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.440
[CHEEKS FLAPPING]

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.490
[BARK]

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.160
[LAUGHING]
[BARKING]

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.210
Bubble!
[PLOP]

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.260
MAX (VOICEOVER):
[CHUCKLING] Yeah.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.310
We have fun.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.070
[BARKING]

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.160
And by the way, I'm
still not a kid person.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.990
I'm talking about this kid.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.760
This is my kid.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:34.930
He's perfect, and I'm
never going to let

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.240
anything bad happen to him.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.290
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.340
[TRAFFIC HUMMING]

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:42.530
But I got to say, keeping
Liam safe is a full time job.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.050
Oh!
Ah!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.560
[GASPS] No, no, no.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.040
Ah.
[SLURPING]

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.090
- [LAUGHS]
- Eh.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:49.140
Wa-hoo!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.470
[ZANY MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.010
- Oh!
- Ah!

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.060
[GIGGLES]
[SWISH]

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.950
[BABBLING]

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.450
All right.
OK.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.050
Uh, hello.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.550
Everything's cool.
[COOING]

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.950
Now, we don't-- we
don't want any trouble!

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.000
Yah!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.270
[ENGINE BLARING]

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.760
[SWISH]
MAX: Liam?

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.310
[CLICKING]
- Uh!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.800
You OK there, buddy?

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.210
Was the world
always this dangerous?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.260
[SHUDDERS]

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:14.690
[TRAFFIC ZOOMING]

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:18.000
[THUNDER CRACKS]

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.050
Uh!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.100
[TICKING]

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.450
[GRUNTING] huh.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.330
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:30.260
[MUMBLING]

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:35.230
[CONTENTEDLY SIGHS]

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.710
[THEME MUSIC - ALEXANDRE
DESPLAT]

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:50.130
[SWOOSH]

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:58.030
[SNORING] Mm!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.580
[SIGHS] Ah!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:07.500
[THUD] [SPUTTERS] [PURRS]

